          "text": "Watch for an unexplained jump in your water bill, a warm spot on the floor, the sound of running water when every fixture is off, or new cracks in flooring or walls. We use electronic detection to pinpoint slab leaks before opening the floor, and we'll often reroute the line overhead so it doesn't happen again."
        }
